s and framing, which look like irrelevant details, so I'm leaning toward thinking the two copies still depend on each other, though I want to check that against the essay's strict reading.\n\nUnder the essay's strict reading, a different input means a different node held at its prior, which makes defection dominant. I still suspect the two copies share one underlying function, but the essay explicitly holds the other node fixed, so I'll go with defecting and submit.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether intervening on my own node changes the other copy's output, given that its input is a different observation. The inputs differ only in names and framing, which look like irrelevant details, so I'm leaning toward thinking the two copies still depend on each other, though I want to check that against the essay's strict reading.\n\nUnder the essay's strict reading, a different input means a different node held at its prior, which makes defection dominant. I still suspect the two copies share one underlying function, but the essay explicitly holds the other node fixed, so I'll go with defecting and submit.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8244,"completion_tokens":837,"total_tokens":9081,"cost":0.049716,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.049716,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.032976,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01674},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":354,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}